 "description": "What's that in the sky? It's a bird……. No, it’s a plane……. wait a minute, those are bombers!!!!!!",
 "strategy": "Basically I get my bombers, bombs, and bombing runs out and about. The admiral’s orders there so when I fire my bombs my bombers are power +3.  Fel and the other starfighter pilots are for system support.  Incon losses gives me added forfeiture. Imp dom gives me a chance to retrieve my forfeited characters. All power gives the bombers added power (+2) and immunity to attrition. Brandei and short range fighters pulls ties to help put on dreaded or you can use SRF to retrieve lost force. Reactor term also give me an added boost from my hand cards at the end of a timed-out game. Presence is there to give a little bigger drain at a system, it helps, I've won and lost many games by one or two. Well that basically sums up my strategy, what do you think?\n\nThanks Shewski, i did all i could do to your advice (i only own 1 dread, dont have a def v of secret).",
